## Validation contract

`LocalStateGateway` validates settings, supplier/category, invoice/line, payment, and daily-income envelopes, their references, and invoice payment balance/status consistency. ISO calendar dates and UTC timestamps are checked strictly, so impossible values such as `2026-02-30` recover to empty state with `needs_seed`; valid ISO values remain `ready`. `loadSeed()` and `restore()` clone deterministic fake data and write it atomically. No UI/provider/router, domain type, Supabase, or auth behavior was added.

